  "benefits": "\n  - **Subsidized Mushroom Kits:** Kits provided at ₹60/- each with a 90% subsidy.  - **High-Quality Materials:** Kits weigh 5 kg and include 100 grams of superior mushroom spawn.  - **Training Support:** 2-days group training is provided, with a daily allowance of ₹1000/- per farmer.\n&lt;br&gt;\n\n",
